message: "If you use care-voice in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "care-voice"
abstract: >-
  An open-source daily voice check-in agent for older adults living alone.
  It runs a short scripted conversation, extracts structured answers,
  applies transparent alert rules, and notifies caregivers.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "superintelligenceco contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/superintelligenceco/care-voice"
url: "https://superintelligenceco.github.io/care-voice/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
keywords:
  - caregiving
  - voice agent
  - check-in
  - aging in place
  - alerts
